      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Millstadt%2C_Illinois",
      "category": "people",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "The town’s original name proposal was Centerville, chosen because the site sat roughly midway between Belleville, Columbia, and Pittsburg Lake.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        14
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Millstadt%2C_Illinois",
      "category": "etymology",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "The Millstadt Historical Society’s museum, now open, showcases early 1900s homes and local stories for visitors and residents alike.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        7
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
